</groundspeak:short_description><groundspeak:long_description>&lt;p&gt;This cache is located inside Cherokee Park located along Gregory Creek in Liberty Township. The path is the Turnbridge Cherokee Path as the paved trail and also includes mowed trails. A &lt;a href="https://youtu.be/4IwCUj4rFxw"&gt;video of the paved&lt;/a&gt; trail can be seen here. The parking is accessed inside the neighborhood.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There is a fishing lake here and wildflowers planted along the way. The cache is off of the paved area for a fun adventure.&lt;/p&gt;

